{"title": "AI全栈开发工程师-数据平台", "title_raw": "AI全栈开发工程师-数据平台", "location": [], "location_raw": "", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "1、参与快手数据中台产品的全栈研发,覆盖前端交互、后端服务、数据接入与计算全链路，独立负责或主导中等复杂度模块的设计与落地；\n2、前端侧：基于 React/Vue 等主流框架，构建高性能、高可用的数据平台 Web 应用；优化大数据量场景下的可视化、交互与渲染体验；后端侧：基于 Java/Go 等技术栈，设计并实现高并发、高可靠的服务；对接 Hive/Spark/Flink/ClickHouse/Doris 等大数据引擎，保障数据链路的稳定与性能；承担工程质量建设：单元测试、集成测试、自动化回归、灰度发布、监控告警，践行“研发即质量”的一体化交付模式；\n3、深入业务场景,与产品经理、数据工程师、业务方紧密协作，把复杂的数据能力转化为易用的产品能力，支撑短视频、直播、电商、广告、生活服务等核心业务的数据决策。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "autumn_campus", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://campus.kuaishou.cn/#/campus/jobs?recruitSubProjectCodes=20271779425607", "post_date": "1786557330000", "_raw_keys": ["id", "code", "type", "hasInner", "positionStatusCode", "recruitProjectCode", "recruitSubProjectCode", "hcHoldTime", "name", "departmentCode", "departmentName", "businessDirectoryCode", "positionClassCode", "ifFrontLineEmployee", "welfareLabelCode", "workingHoursNature", "positionNatureCode", "positionCategoryCode", "positionRankCode", "positionLevelCode"], "id": "4b50d07750e0ed2f", "company": "快手", "company_id": "kuaishou", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-13T09:57:39.817776+08:00"}
