{"title": "用户产品经理", "title_raw": "用户产品经理", "location": [], "location_raw": "", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "1、负责各端产品从规划、设计、制作、开发、测试到最终上线整个产品周期，并对产品数据负责；\n2、负责产品需求文档的撰写及产品原型绘制，协助开发团队理解和掌握需求，对产品需求方向和易用性负责；\n3、负责项目周期和进度把控，确保项目进度，快速、高效推进功能上线；\n4、与运营、市场等团队紧密配合，完成产品目标的达成，在产品层面对合作类项目予以支持。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "autumn_campus", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://campus.kuaishou.cn/#/campus/jobs?recruitSubProjectCodes=20271779425607", "post_date": "1786546301000", "_raw_keys": ["id", "code", "type", "hasInner", "positionStatusCode", "recruitProjectCode", "recruitSubProjectCode", "hcHoldTime", "name", "departmentCode", "departmentName", "businessDirectoryCode", "positionClassCode", "ifFrontLineEmployee", "welfareLabelCode", "workingHoursNature", "positionNatureCode", "positionCategoryCode", "positionRankCode", "positionLevelCode"], "id": "b0642c0863c9a1e7", "company": "快手", "company_id": "kuaishou", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-13T09:57:40.512655+08:00"}
{"title": "HR-BP类", "title_raw": "HR-BP类", "location": [], "location_raw": "", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "加入快手HRBP团队，你将成为业务团队的战略合作伙伴，深度参与公司核心业务发展，在复杂多变的业务场景中锻炼全局视角和解决问题的能力；探索AI在组织诊断、人才洞察等场景的应用，快速成长为具备战略思维的HR专家，助力组织与个人共同成功。\n\n【这个岗位在做什么】\n1、深入了解业务与组织现状，协助负责人梳理组织设计和人员落位，推动落地，提升团队效能；\n2、关注人才配置合理性，设计人才成长路径，为全周期培养提供支持；\n3、推动人力资源项目在业务部门落地，建立有效沟通渠道，帮助管理者提升团队凝聚力；\n4、不仅是AI的应用者，更要牵引业务侧拥抱AI落地，让AI深度融入组织场景中。\n\n【为什么是快手】 \n组织问题没有标准答案，AI也没有，在这里你既可以探索和应用AI看清问题，同时也来解AI回答不了的问题，读懂人、判断组织、推动改变，你是那个让改变真正发生的人。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "autumn_campus", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://campus.kuaishou.cn/#/campus/jobs?recruitSubProjectCodes=20271779425607", "post_date": "1786545959000", "_raw_keys": ["id", "code", "type", "hasInner", "positionStatusCode", "recruitProjectCode", "recruitSubProjectCode", "hcHoldTime", "name", "departmentCode", "departmentName", "businessDirectoryCode", "positionClassCode", "ifFrontLineEmployee", "welfareLabelCode", "workingHoursNature", "positionNatureCode", "positionCategoryCode", "positionRankCode", "positionLevelCode"], "id": "e72a1ba6d41a9718", "company": "快手", "company_id": "kuaishou", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-13T09:57:40.650697+08:00"}
{"title": "HR-战略招聘", "title_raw": "HR-战略招聘", "location": [], "location_raw": "", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "这个岗位要做的事，是面向组织战略布局未来。\n有时候是研究：行业、公司为什么发生变化，背后的人发生了什么；\n有时候是判断：一个人现在不会动，但未来可能正是我们需要他的时候；\n有时候是建立信任：在对方还不知道自己要离开的时候；\n战略招聘做的，是在招聘发生之前很久就把事情想清楚。\n\n【工作内容】\n1、根据公司战略，持续拓展高阶人才的供给通道，主动建立与关键人才的连接，为各业务做前瞻性人才储备；\n2、深入研究国内外标杆公司的业务演变、组织变化和人才流动，提炼行业洞察，为战略招聘决策提供真实依据；\n3、关注新兴赛道，探索适合公司阶段的人才甄选方法论，持续输出有效的招聘策略和人才规划。\n\n【对 AI 的期待】\n你应该已经在用 AI 处理信息密集型的工作：行业研究、人才图谱整理、竞对动态追踪。我们希望你不只是\"会用\"，而是真的用 AI 把自己的判断速度和研究深度拉到一个新层级。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "autumn_campus", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://campus.kuaishou.cn/#/campus/jobs?recruitSubProjectCodes=20271779425607", "post_date": "1786545828000", "_raw_keys": ["id", "code", "type", "hasInner", "positionStatusCode", "recruitProjectCode", "recruitSubProjectCode", "hcHoldTime", "name", "departmentCode", "departmentName", "businessDirectoryCode", "positionClassCode", "ifFrontLineEmployee", "welfareLabelCode", "workingHoursNature", "positionNatureCode", "positionCategoryCode", "positionRankCode", "positionLevelCode"], "id": "887e4218250022b6", "company": "快手", "company_id": "kuaishou", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-13T09:57:40.729228+08:00"}
